  "title": "Mom’s Chocolate Meringue Pie",
  "description": "Mom’s chocolate pie with meringue is a chocolate lover’s delight! Rich, creamy chocolate custard covered with a sweet, glossy meringue topping — delish!",
  "authors": [
    "Mary Ann Benzon"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-22T18:32:50-04:00",
